{"version":1,"content":"<p>金馬執委會今日公布第63屆金馬獎華麗頒獎嘉賓陣容，過去三任金馬執委會主席張艾嘉（第51-54屆）、李安（第55-58屆）、李屏賓（第59-62屆）回來力挺新任主席張震。</p><p>金馬影后舒淇、桂綸鎂和謝盈萱等。</p><p>國際嘉賓包括奧斯卡最佳導演奉俊昊、積極邁</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.699389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:34:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.327673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.327673+00:00","content_hash":"ec16f65e63f66c3969075e14e5a57e6475aff88b11f7704f7c226cd1c217925b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}